{"timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:24:23.549Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"afbb6be2-aws_ew1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If pregnancy has you wide awake at 2 a.m., wondering whether that twinge is normal, this lesson is for you.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will walk through ten small, concrete habits that protect both your health and your sanity.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence frames the lesson's overall purpose and structure, connecting the individual habits described in the source material to the learner's goal of maintaining health and sanity during pregnancy.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The flow moves from daily routines, like movement, food, and vitamins, to mental calm, like journaling and trusted information.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence clarifies the organizational structure of the lesson, grouping the source material's individual habits into thematic categories to help learners understand the progression from physical to mental wellbeing.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Then we zoom out to big-picture preparation: understanding labor, training your pelvic floor, and planning for postpartum.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence clarifies the final phase of the lesson structure, grouping the source material's later habits around birth preparation and postpartum planning to complete the narrative arc from daily habits to long-term readiness.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd","textChunks":["\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If pregnancy has you wide awake at 2 a.m., wondering whether that twinge is normal, this lesson is for you.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will walk through ten small, concrete habits that protect both your health and your sanity.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence frames the lesson's overall purpose and structure, connecting the individual habits described in the source material to the learner's goal of maintaining health and sanity during pregnancy.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The flow moves from daily routines, like movement, food, and vitamins, to mental calm, like journaling and trusted information.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence clarifies the organizational structure of the lesson, grouping the source material's individual habits into thematic categories to help learners understand the progression from physical to mental wellbeing.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Then we zoom out to big-picture preparation: understanding labor, training your pelvic floor, and planning for postpartum.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence clarifies the final phase of the lesson structure, grouping the source material's later habits around birth preparation and postpartum planning to complete the narrative arc from daily habits to long-term readiness.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd","-7f9a-b47e-9992a12863ae\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Movement during pregnancy follows a pattern that changes with each trimester.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the first trimester, start with a simple ten-minute walk, which supports circulation and blood sugar regulation and may ease nausea for some people.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the second trimester, as energy returns, gradually build duration or intensity, perhaps adding prenatal yoga, swimming, or light resistance training.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the third trimester, keep moving if comfortable, but shorten sessions and lower the intensity as needed.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Gentle activity matters because it supports endurance, reduces aches, and helps prepare your body for the physical demands of labor and recovery.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Before starting or changing any exercise program during pregnancy, always consult your medical provider.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d9307a6f-83b3-716c-bdaf-ff3eb467b91e\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73f6-b657-81db95d6d295\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Here is how the talk test works in real life.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Imagine you are on a walk or in a prenatal yoga class during your second trimester.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {","\n          \"text\": \"Try to speak a full sentence out loud.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If you are too winded to finish it, that is your signal to ease off and reduce the intensity.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This builds on the first-trimester ten-minute walk and prepares you for the third-trimester pattern of shorter, gentler sessions.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-72cc-85cd-89a368438430\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Nutrition during pregnancy rests on two simple habits: protein at every meal and prenatals at night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"ba4d898c-1f1d-702e-b84f-bf26e5401922\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy hormones can slow digestion and affect appetite and blood sugar, so including protein at every meal makes meals more filling and supplies amino acids needed for growth and development.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Reach for protein-rich foods like eggs, yogurt, cheese, legumes, and fish that is low in mercury and fully cooked.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"0cb42f00-59f9-736f-8af7-4406fbd9902c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Stay safe by skipping fish high in mercury or served raw, and follow your clinician's advice on handling deli meats.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b31413e5-3aaf-7fde-8e77-930eb14e08f6\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Keep a simple protein snack on your nightstand, like nuts or a suitable protein bar, in case you wake up hungry or feel unwell on an empty stomach.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"5621d9a6-35b9-7bd5-a9bd-bf90b893abeb\"]\n        }",",\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The iron in many prenatal vitamins may trigger nausea, particularly when taken without food.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ba4d898c-1f1d-702e-b84f-bf26e5401922\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Taking your prenatal with dinner or at bedtime may make it easier to tolerate, and vitamin C-containing foods can support iron absorption.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Place your prenatals near something you use every evening, like your toothbrush or nightstand, to make the routine easier to remember.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"a403f9c5-23eb-73d2-8e9d-8d6cdb785e21\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7bdf-9035-5ae558cbfcd3\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Searching for symptoms late at night can increase anxiety, especially when results highlight serious but uncommon conditions.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Getting lots of conflicting advice from social media, forums, or relatives often makes decisions harder.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d545a14b-3707-74bf-b162-86263bd568ae\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Your action plan: set an evening cutoff for open-ended symptom searches.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Save one or two reliable sources, like your provider's portal or after-hours nurse line, and reach out to your care team when symptoms worry you.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Learn the warning signs that need immediate reporting: heavy bleeding, severe abdominal pain, persistent severe headache, vision changes, chest pain, difficulty breathing, sudden swelling of the face or hands, leaking fluid, noticeably decreased fetal movement, or though","ts of self-harm.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"4b304eb9-058a-7626-9c81-bbdaa02a61b8\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Knowing these urgent warning signs ahead of time can make it easier to seek care promptly.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"For everyday questions, rely on one trusted clinician and one evidence-based information source for medical guidance.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Use online communities mainly for support and shared experiences, not diagnosis.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7124-aa6f-08527f35ef8c\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Understanding what your body will actually do in labor can transform you from a passenger into an active participant.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Learning about labor stages, contractions, and normal progression may reduce fear and help you feel more prepared.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Knowing what phases like transition can feel like may make intense contractions easier to interpret and help you work with your body rather than feeling caught off guard.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"02fa95aa-3ed8-7dd9-90ce-5e6fc65d2c48\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Your pelvic floor supports the uterus, bladder, and bowel, and during birth these muscles need both strength and the ability to relax.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pelvic floor exercises are not only about squeezing; for some people, excessive tightening can worsen an already overactiv","e or tight pelvic floor.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"a41862a7-efdf-7f3f-b46e-518eecb9affa\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If available, consider seeing a pelvic floor physical therapist during pregnancy for assessment and guidance, or use an evidence-based program that includes both engagement and relaxation.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"30c28461-607e-745c-b1bb-0ba6b3963b9c\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f21-8966-c7705eba6d2d\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Journaling preserves what photos and videos cannot: your emotions, fears, excitement, questions, and milestones.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Moments like first feeling the baby move can fade over time, so recording them helps preserve the experience.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"dce93289-fc2d-701c-9c11-0961fb3a114f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Postpartum preparation should include your recovery, sleep disruption, hormonal changes, meals, practical help, and emotional support, not only baby supplies.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Choose one manageable task each week to build your postpartum plan.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You might draft a meal plan, discuss partner or family support, prepare postpartum clothing, or identify a trusted person to call on difficult days.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This weekly rhythm makes preparation feel doable rather than overwhelming.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence clarifies why the weekly approach is recommended, connecting the source's 'one manageab","le task each week' guidance to the emotional benefit of reducing overwhelm, which aligns with the lesson focus on sanity during pregnancy.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73a4-9eaa-e32b3c1692d5\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You now have a ten-habit flow that carries you from today through birth and beyond.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence synthesizes the overall lesson structure, framing the ten individual habits from the source material as a cohesive flow that spans pregnancy through postpartum, which helps learners see the big picture.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Move in a way that matches your trimester, eat protein at every meal, and take your prenatals at night with food.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\", \"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Calm your mind with a clear information plan: memorize the red flags, bookmark trusted sources, and stop the 2 a.m. Googling.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"4b304eb9-058a-7626-9c81-bbdaa02a61b8\", \"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\", \"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Prepare for birth by learning what labor actually involves and training your pelvic floor for both strength and relaxation.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Journal your journey and plan one postpartum task each week.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          ","\"text\": \"Pick one habit to start this week, and build from there.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence provides actionable guidance for learners, encouraging them to begin with a single habit rather than attempting all ten at once, which supports sustainable behavior change and aligns with the lesson's emphasis on manageable steps.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":14484,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":41192,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0ece2-fd2f-7533-9408-bed00830d7cb"}}
