{"timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:26:42.531Z","level":"info","event":"queue.job_dispatched","fields":{"outboxEventId":"01a0ecea-b012-723f-bf36-3309a6eaf903","jobId":"01a0ecea-b012-73c0-849b-272ef39b0f2c","projectId":"01a0ecdc-8067-7926-814a-84d1a29920a5","correlationId":"01a0ece2-fd2f-7533-9408-bed00830d7cb","queueName":"orchestration","service":"pipeline-worker"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:26:44.558Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"b19dc638-aws_ew1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy often comes with a surge of late-night worries and conflicting advice that can leave you feeling overwhelmed.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\", \"d545a14b-3707-74bf-b162-86263bd568ae\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In this lesson, we outline ten habits that protect both your physical health and your mental sanity.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"Frames the lesson scope and promises the structure outlined in the lesson focus\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will move from daily foundations like movement, nutrition, and vitamins to mental calm through journaling and curated information.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Finally, we cover big-picture preparation including labor knowledge, pelvic floor training, and postpartum planning.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\", \"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f9a-b47e-9992a12863ae\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Staying active during pregnancy builds the endurance needed for labor and supports your recovery afterward.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the first trimester, start with a ten-minute walk to boost circulation and regulate blood sugar, which may also ease nausea.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"As your ","textChunks":["{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy often comes with a surge of late-night worries and conflicting advice that can leave you feeling overwhelmed.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\", \"d545a14b-3707-74bf-b162-86263bd568ae\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In this lesson, we outline ten habits that protect both your physical health and your mental sanity.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"Frames the lesson scope and promises the structure outlined in the lesson focus\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will move from daily foundations like movement, nutrition, and vitamins to mental calm through journaling and curated information.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Finally, we cover big-picture preparation including labor knowledge, pelvic floor training, and postpartum planning.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\", \"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f9a-b47e-9992a12863ae\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Staying active during pregnancy builds the endurance needed for labor and supports your recovery afterward.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the first trimester, start with a ten-minute walk to boost circulation and regulate blood sugar, which may also ease nausea.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"As your ","energy returns in the second trimester, gradually increase your duration or intensity, perhaps trying prenatal yoga or swimming.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"During the third trimester, keep moving if comfortable but shorten your sessions and lower the intensity as needed.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Check with your medical provider before you begin or modify any exercise routine while pregnant.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d9307a6f-83b3-716c-bdaf-ff3eb467b91e\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73f6-b657-81db95d6d295\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"To gauge your intensity in the second trimester, use the talk test.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If you cannot speak a complete sentence while exercising because you are too breathless, you should reduce your effort.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This contrasts with the gentle ten-minute walk of the first trimester and the shorter, gentler sessions of the third.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-72cc-85cd-89a368438430\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy hormones can slow digestion and affect your appetite and blood sugar, so include protein at every meal to stay full and supply amino acids for growth.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Suitable choices include eggs, yogurt, cottage cheese, beans, lentils, and thoroughly cooked fish that is low in mercury.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"0cb42f00-59f","9-736f-8af7-4406fbd9902c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Avoid high-mercury fish and raw or undercooked fish, and handle deli meats according to your clinician's guidance.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b31413e5-3aaf-7fde-8e77-930eb14e08f6\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Keep a protein snack like nuts on your nightstand for when you wake up hungry or feel unwell on an empty stomach.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"5621d9a6-35b9-7bd5-a9bd-bf90b893abeb\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Take your prenatal vitamin with dinner or at bedtime to reduce iron-related nausea, and place it near your toothbrush to build the habit.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ba4d898c-1f1d-702e-b84f-bf26e5401922\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\", \"a403f9c5-23eb-73d2-8e9d-8d6cdb785e21\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7bdf-9035-5ae558cbfcd3\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Searching for symptoms late at night can heighten anxiety because results often highlight serious conditions that are actually rare.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Stop doing open-ended symptom searches after a specific time in the evening, and save links to reliable resources like your provider's portal or nurse line.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Recognize the urgent warning signs: heavy bleeding, severe abdominal pain, persistent severe headache, changes in vision, chest pain, trouble breathing, sudden swelling in your face or hands, leaking fluid, reduced fetal movement, or thoughts of harming yourself.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"4b304eb9-058a-7626-9c81-bbdaa02a61b8\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Getting lots of different opinions from social media or relatives can make decisions more confusing.\",\n          \"sourceBl","ockIds\": [\"d545a14b-3707-74bf-b162-86263bd568ae\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Rely on one trusted clinician and one evidence-based source for medical guidance, using online communities mainly for support rather than diagnosis.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7124-aa6f-08527f35ef8c\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Understanding labor stages, contractions, and normal progression reduces fear and helps you feel prepared.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Learning about the transition phase allows you to make sense of strong contractions and cooperate with your body instead of being surprised.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"02fa95aa-3ed8-7dd9-90ce-5e6fc65d2c48\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"These muscles hold up your uterus, bladder, and bowel, and during delivery they require the capacity to both engage and release.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Training involves more than just tightening; doing too many squeezes can aggravate muscles that are already overactive or tense.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"a41862a7-efdf-7f3f-b46e-518eecb9affa\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Consider seeing a pelvic floor physical therapist or using an evidence-based program that includes both engagement and relaxation.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"30c28461-607e-745c-b1bb-0ba6b3963b9c\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f21-8966-c7705eba6d2d\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Photos capture how things looked, but journaling preserves your emotions, fears, excitement, questions, and milestones.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Recording moments l","ike first feeling the baby move helps preserve the experience before memories fade.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"dce93289-fc2d-701c-9c11-0961fb3a114f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Postpartum preparation should cover your recovery, sleep disruption, hormonal changes, meals, practical help, and emotional support, not just baby supplies.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Choose one manageable task each week, such as drafting a meal plan, discussing family support, preparing postpartum clothing, or identifying a trusted person to call on difficult days.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73a4-9eaa-e32b3c1692d5\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We have covered a flow from trimester-matched movement to protein at every meal with prenatals at night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\", \"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You now have a calm information plan with red flags memorized and trusted sources bookmarked, plus labor knowledge and pelvic floor training for active participation.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\", \"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Finally, journaling and weekly postpartum planning help you prepare emotionally and practically for birth and beyond.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pick one habit to start this week and build from there.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n    ","      \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"Closing call to action encouraging immediate application of the lesson content\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":10213,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":41934,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0ece2-fd2f-7533-9408-bed00830d7cb"}}
