{"timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:39:13.510Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"e21c8310-aws_ec1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy often feels like a series of surprises, and the hardest ones seem to arrive in the middle of the night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"illustration\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline asks for a hook built around the 2 a.m. panic theme; this framing image is not stated in the source.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This lesson gives you ten small, concrete habits that protect both your health and your peace of mind.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline requires promising a set of small, concrete habits for health and sanity; this framing sentence is not stated in the source.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will move through a clear flow: daily routines like movement, food, and vitamins, then mental calm through journaling and trusted information, and finally big-picture preparation for labor, your pelvic floor, and life after birth.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline calls for previewing the lesson's flow from daily routines to mental calm to big-picture preparation; this roadmap phrasing is a generated addition.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f9a-b47e-9992a12863ae\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Think of movement during pregnancy as a pattern that changes shape as your body changes.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"analogy\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline asks to teach the pattern as a flow; the shape-shifting com","textChunks":["{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy often feels like a series of surprises, and the hardest ones seem to arrive in the middle of the night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"illustration\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline asks for a hook built around the 2 a.m. panic theme; this framing image is not stated in the source.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This lesson gives you ten small, concrete habits that protect both your health and your peace of mind.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline requires promising a set of small, concrete habits for health and sanity; this framing sentence is not stated in the source.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will move through a clear flow: daily routines like movement, food, and vitamins, then mental calm through journaling and trusted information, and finally big-picture preparation for labor, your pelvic floor, and life after birth.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline calls for previewing the lesson's flow from daily routines to mental calm to big-picture preparation; this roadmap phrasing is a generated addition.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f9a-b47e-9992a12863ae\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Think of movement during pregnancy as a pattern that changes shape as your body changes.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"analogy\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline asks to teach the pattern as a flow; the shape-shifting com","parison is a teaching device not present in the source.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the first trimester, a simple ten-minute walk is enough, because gentle activity supports circulation and blood sugar regulation and may even ease nausea for some people.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the second trimester, as energy returns, you can gradually build duration or intensity, or try prenatal yoga, swimming, or light resistance training.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the third trimester, keep moving if it feels comfortable, but shorten your sessions and lower the intensity as needed.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Staying active matters because it builds endurance, reduces aches, and helps prepare your body for the physical demands of labor and for recovery afterward.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Before starting or changing any exercise routine while pregnant, always check with your medical provider first.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d9307a6f-83b3-716c-bdaf-ff3eb467b91e\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73f6-b657-81db95d6d295\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"So how do you know if your second-trimester workout is the right intensity? Use the talk test.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Picture yourself on a walk or in a prenatal yoga class: try saying a full sentence out loud, and if you are too breathless to finish it, ease off.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Notice the flow across pregnancy: ten gentle minut","es in the first trimester, talk-test-guided progression in the second, and shorter, gentler sessions in the third.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-72cc-85cd-89a368438430\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Next come two daily fuel habits: protein at every meal, and prenatal vitamins at night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline frames this item as a two-part nutrition habit; this signposting sentence is a generated addition.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy hormones can slow digestion and shift your appetite and blood sugar, so protein helps make meals more filling while supplying the amino acids needed for growth and development.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Good options include eggs, Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, beans, lentils, and properly cooked low-mercury fish.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"0cb42f00-59f9-736f-8af7-4406fbd9902c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"For safety, avoid high-mercury fish and raw or undercooked fish, and handle and heat deli meats according to your clinician's or local public-health guidance.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b31413e5-3aaf-7fde-8e77-930eb14e08f6\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If you wake up hungry or feel unwell on an empty stomach, keep a simple protein snack like nuts or a suitable protein bar on your nightstand.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"5621d9a6-35b9-7bd5-a9bd-bf90b893abeb\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Many prenatal vitamins contain iron, which can cause nausea, especially on an empty stomach, so taking yours with dinner or at bedtime may be easier to tolerate, and"," vitamin C-rich foods can support iron absorption.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ba4d898c-1f1d-702e-b84f-bf26e5401922\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"To make the habit stick, place your prenatals next to something you use every evening, like your toothbrush or nightstand.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"a403f9c5-23eb-73d2-8e9d-8d6cdb785e21\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7bdf-9035-5ae558cbfcd3\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Now let's calm the worry loop, starting with a habit to drop: searching symptoms at two in the morning.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline frames this item as calming the worry loop; this transition sentence is a generated addition.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Late-night searching tends to raise anxiety, because results often spotlight serious but uncommon conditions.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The fix is an action plan: stop open-ended symptom searches after a set evening time, and bookmark one or two trusted sources, such as your provider's portal or after-hours nurse line.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Some symptoms, though, should never wait until morning.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"A short transition clarifying that the evening cutoff does not apply to red-flag symptoms; this bridging sentence is not in the source.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Report these immediately: heavy bleeding, severe abdominal pain, headache, vision changes, chest pain, difficulty breathing, sudden swelling of the face or hands, leaking flui","d, noticeably decreased fetal movement, or thoughts of self-harm.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"4b304eb9-058a-7626-9c81-bbdaa02a61b8\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Knowing these warning signs ahead of time makes it easier to seek care promptly.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Finally, conflicting opinions from social media, forums, or relatives can make decisions more confusing, so rely on one trusted clinician and one evidence-based source for medical guidance, and use online communities mainly for support, not diagnosis.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d545a14b-3707-74bf-b162-86263bd568ae\", \"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7124-aa6f-08527f35ef8c\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Knowledge is its own form of calm, and that is especially true for labor.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"A bridging sentence connecting the previous calm theme to labor knowledge; this framing is not stated in the source.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Understanding labor stages, contractions, and normal progression can reduce fear and help you feel more prepared.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"When you know what a phase like transition can feel like, intense contractions become easier to interpret, so you can work with your body instead of feeling caught off guard.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"02fa95aa-3ed8-7dd9-90ce-5e6fc65d2c48\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The same participant mindset applies to your pelvic floor, the muscles that support your uterus, bladder, and bowel.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\"]\n        },\n","        {\n          \"text\": \"During birth, these muscles need both strength and the ability to relax, so squeezing alone is not the whole picture, and for some people excessive tightening can worsen an already tight pelvic floor.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\", \"a41862a7-efdf-7f3f-b46e-518eecb9affa\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If you can, see a pelvic floor physical therapist during pregnancy for assessment and guidance, or follow an evidence-based program that trains both engagement and relaxation.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"30c28461-607e-745c-b1bb-0ba6b3963b9c\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f21-8966-c7705eba6d2d\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Two more habits will carry you from today all the way past birth: writing things down, and planning ahead one week at a time.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline pairs journaling with weekly postpartum prep; this signposting sentence is a generated addition.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Photos and videos capture how things looked, but a journal preserves what they cannot: your emotions, fears, excitement, questions, and milestones.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Moments like the first time you feel the baby move can fade over time, so recording them helps preserve the experience.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"dce93289-fc2d-701c-9c11-0961fb3a114f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Then there is postpartum planning, which should start now, not after the baby arrives.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Real preparation covers your recovery, sleep disruption, hormonal changes, meals, practical help, and emotional support, n","ot just baby supplies.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The routine is simple: choose one manageable task each week, such as drafting a meal plan, discussing partner or family support, preparing postpartum clothing, or identifying a trusted person to call on difficult days.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73a4-9eaa-e32b3c1692d5\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Here is your full ten-habit flow.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline requires a recap opener; this short signpost is a generated addition.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Match your movement to your trimester, from a ten-minute walk to talk-test progression to shorter, gentler sessions.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Eat protein at every meal, and take your prenatal with dinner or at bedtime.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Protect your calm: memorize the red flags, bookmark trusted sources, and lean on one clinician plus one evidence-based source instead of crowdsourced worry.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\", \"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Learn what labor actually involves, and train your pelvic floor for both strength and relaxation so you can participate, not just endure.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\"]\n","        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Journal the moments photos miss, and plan for postpartum one weekly task at a time.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You do not need all ten today, so pick one habit and start it this week.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"The outline calls for a closing encouragement to pick one habit; this motivational close is a generated addition.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":14634,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":50866,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0ece2-fd2f-7533-9408-bed00830d7cb"}}
