{"timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:39:31.445Z","level":"info","event":"queue.job_dispatched","fields":{"outboxEventId":"01a0ecf6-6bc2-7c14-85f6-107dd1e0618d","jobId":"01a0ecf6-6bc2-78e2-a98c-b9d6b79c0ae7","projectId":"01a0ecdc-8067-7926-814a-84d1a29920a5","correlationId":"01a0ece2-fd2f-7533-9408-bed00830d7cb","queueName":"orchestration","service":"pipeline-worker"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:39:31.455Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"853b8775-aws_ec1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"{\"repairs\":[{\"blockIndex\":3,\"sentenceIndex\":2,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"You might reach for eggs, Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, beans, or lentils, along with low-mercury fish that has been cooked all the way through.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":3,\"sentenceIndex\":3,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"A few safety notes matter here. Skip fish that is high in mercury or served raw or undercooked. And treat deli meats the way your clinician or local public-health guidance recommends, including heating them as directed.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":4,\"sentenceIndex\":2,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Here is a practical fix. Pick a cutoff time each evening, and after that, no more open-ended searching. Instead, save a couple of reliable go-tos ahead of time, like your provider's portal or the after-hours nurse line.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":4,\"sentenceIndex\":4,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Some symptoms should never wait. Call right away for heavy bleeding or severe abdominal pain. The same goes for a bad headache, changes in your vision, chest pain, or trouble breathing. Also report sudden swelling in your face or hands, fluid leaking, a clear drop in your baby's movement, or any thoughts of harming yourself.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":4,\"sentenceIndex\":6,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"When everyone around you weighs in, from social media feeds to family group chats, the mixed messages can leave you more confused than informed. So simplify things. Let one clinician you trust and one solid evidence-based source guide your medical decisions. Treat online communities as a place for encouragement and shared stories, not for diagnosing anything.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":5,\"sentenceIndex\":1,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"When you know how labor unfolds, from its stages to what contractions do and how things typically progress, the whole experience tends to feel less frightening, and you go in feeling readier.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":5,\"sentenceIndex\":4,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"For birth, these muscles have to be strong, but they also have to let go. That is why Kegels alone do not ","textChunks":["{\"repairs\":[{\"blockIndex\":3,\"sentenceIndex\":2,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"You might reach for eggs, Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, beans, or lentils, along with low-mercury fish that has been cooked all the way through.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":3,\"sentenceIndex\":3,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"A few safety notes matter here. Skip fish that is high in mercury or served raw or undercooked. And treat deli meats the way your clinician or local public-health guidance recommends, including heating them as directed.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":4,\"sentenceIndex\":2,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Here is a practical fix. Pick a cutoff time each evening, and after that, no more open-ended searching. Instead, save a couple of reliable go-tos ahead of time, like your provider's portal or the after-hours nurse line.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":4,\"sentenceIndex\":4,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Some symptoms should never wait. Call right away for heavy bleeding or severe abdominal pain. The same goes for a bad headache, changes in your vision, chest pain, or trouble breathing. Also report sudden swelling in your face or hands, fluid leaking, a clear drop in your baby's movement, or any thoughts of harming yourself.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":4,\"sentenceIndex\":6,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"When everyone around you weighs in, from social media feeds to family group chats, the mixed messages can leave you more confused than informed. So simplify things. Let one clinician you trust and one solid evidence-based source guide your medical decisions. Treat online communities as a place for encouragement and shared stories, not for diagnosing anything.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":5,\"sentenceIndex\":1,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"When you know how labor unfolds, from its stages to what contractions do and how things typically progress, the whole experience tends to feel less frightening, and you go in feeling readier.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":5,\"sentenceIndex\":4,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"For birth, these muscles have to be strong, but they also have to let go. That is why Kegels alone do not ","cover it. In fact, if your pelvic floor is already overactive or tight, more squeezing can actually make things worse.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":5,\"sentenceIndex\":5,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"If it is available to you, a pelvic floor physical therapist can assess you during pregnancy and guide your training. Another good route is a well-supported program that teaches you how to engage these muscles and how to release them.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":6,\"sentenceIndex\":2,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"That first flutter of your baby moving is the kind of memory that can slip away with the years. Writing it down while it is fresh keeps it yours.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":6,\"sentenceIndex\":4,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Getting ready means thinking beyond the baby gear. It means planning for how you will heal, how broken your sleep may be, and the hormonal shifts ahead. It also means lining up meals, hands-on help, and people who can support you emotionally.\"}]},{\"blockIndex\":6,\"sentenceIndex\":5,\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Keep the routine light. Each week, pick just one doable task. That might be sketching out a meal plan, talking through how your partner or family will pitch in, setting aside comfortable postpartum clothes, or deciding who you will call when a hard day hits.\"}]}]}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":3247,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":17937,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0ece2-fd2f-7533-9408-bed00830d7cb"}}
