{"timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:40:44.039Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"7a30c931-aws_ec1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy comes with enough unknowns, and the last thing you need is a spiral of worry in the middle of the night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This lesson walks you through ten small, concrete habits that protect both your physical health and your peace of mind.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\", \"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will move from daily routines like movement, food, and vitamins, to mental calm through journaling and trusted information, and finally to big-picture preparation for labor, your pelvic floor, and life after birth.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\", \"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\", \"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f9a-b47e-9992a12863ae\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Movement during pregnancy is not about pushing hard; it is about a pattern that shifts as your body changes.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the first trimester, start with a simple ten-minute walk, because gentle motion supports circulation and blood sugar balance and may even ease nausea for some people.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"As energy returns in the second trimester, you can slowly build duration or intensity, or try prenatal yoga, swimming, or light resistance work.\",\n          \"sourceBlo","textChunks":["{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"narration-v1\",\n  \"targetDurationSeconds\": 300,\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7d8d-b948-efcb49cb263b\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy comes with enough unknowns, and the last thing you need is a spiral of worry in the middle of the night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"This lesson walks you through ten small, concrete habits that protect both your physical health and your peace of mind.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\", \"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"We will move from daily routines like movement, food, and vitamins, to mental calm through journaling and trusted information, and finally to big-picture preparation for labor, your pelvic floor, and life after birth.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\", \"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\", \"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f9a-b47e-9992a12863ae\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Movement during pregnancy is not about pushing hard; it is about a pattern that shifts as your body changes.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In the first trimester, start with a simple ten-minute walk, because gentle motion supports circulation and blood sugar balance and may even ease nausea for some people.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"As energy returns in the second trimester, you can slowly build duration or intensity, or try prenatal yoga, swimming, or light resistance work.\",\n          \"sourceBlo","ckIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"By the third trimester, keep moving if it feels comfortable, but shorten your sessions and dial back the effort.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Staying active matters because it supports endurance, reduces aches, and helps prepare your body for the physical demands of labor and recovery.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ab1cf706-71bd-7ca1-b531-ab624c44f3e1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Before you start or change any exercise routine, check in with your medical provider first.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d9307a6f-83b3-716c-bdaf-ff3eb467b91e\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73f6-b657-81db95d6d295\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Here is how the talk test works in real life.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Imagine you are on a walk or in a prenatal yoga class during your second trimester, and you try to say a full sentence out loud.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If you are too breathless to finish that sentence, that is your signal to ease off the intensity.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Compare that to the first trimester, where a ten-minute walk is the whole goal, and the third trimester, where sessions get shorter and gentler.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The pattern flows with your pregnancy, always adjusting to what your body can comfortably do.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\"]\n        }\n      ]","\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-72cc-85cd-89a368438430\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Nutrition during pregnancy comes down to two steady habits: protein at every meal and prenatal vitamins at night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Pregnancy hormones can slow digestion and shift your appetite and blood sugar, so protein helps make meals more satisfying and supplies the amino acids your baby needs for growth.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Good protein options include eggs, Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, beans, lentils, and properly cooked low-mercury fish.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"0cb42f00-59f9-736f-8af7-4406fbd9902c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"For safety, avoid high-mercury fish and any raw or undercooked fish, and handle deli meats according to your clinician's or local public-health guidance.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b31413e5-3aaf-7fde-8e77-930eb14e08f6\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Keep a simple protein snack like nuts or a protein bar on your nightstand in case you wake up hungry or feel unwell on an empty stomach.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"5621d9a6-35b9-7bd5-a9bd-bf90b893abeb\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"As for prenatal vitamins, many contain iron, which can trigger nausea, especially without food.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"ba4d898c-1f1d-702e-b84f-bf26e5401922\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Taking your prenatal with dinner or at bedtime can make it easier to tolerate, and vitamin C-rich foods can help your body absorb the iron.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"To build the habit, place your vitamins near something you use every evening, like your toothbrush or nightstand.\",\n","          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"a403f9c5-23eb-73d2-8e9d-8d6cdb785e21\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7bdf-9035-5ae558cbfcd3\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"One of the fastest ways to spike anxiety during pregnancy is searching symptoms online late at night.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Search results often highlight serious but rare conditions, which can make a small worry feel enormous at two in the morning.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"55308f25-9a85-7a2f-ba86-82f8e5de2cf7\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The fix is to set an evening cutoff for open-ended symptom searches and instead bookmark one or two trusted sources, like your provider's portal or an after-hours nurse line.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If something concerning comes up, contact your care team directly rather than scrolling through forums.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"It also helps to know the red flags ahead of time so you can act quickly when it truly matters.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Report these symptoms immediately: heavy bleeding, severe abdominal pain, a persistent severe headache, vision changes, chest pain, difficulty breathing, sudden swelling of your face or hands, leaking fluid, noticeably decreased fetal movement, or any thoughts of self-harm.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"4b304eb9-058a-7626-9c81-bbdaa02a61b8\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Finally, quiet the noise by relying on one trusted clinician and one evidence-based source for medical guidance.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        },\n        ","{\n          \"text\": \"Conflicting opinions from social media, forums, or relatives can make decisions harder, so save online communities for support and shared experience, not diagnosis.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"d545a14b-3707-74bf-b162-86263bd568ae\", \"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7124-aa6f-08527f35ef8c\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Understanding what your body will actually do in labor can transform you from a nervous passenger into an active participant.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Learning about labor stages, contractions, and normal progression can reduce fear and help you feel more prepared.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"When you know what a phase like transition can feel like, intense contractions become easier to interpret, and you can work with your body instead of feeling caught off guard.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"02fa95aa-3ed8-7dd9-90ce-5e6fc65d2c48\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Alongside that knowledge, train your pelvic floor, the group of muscles that supports your uterus, bladder, and bowel.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"During birth, these muscles need both strength and the ability to relax, so squeezing alone is not the whole picture.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\", \"a41862a7-efdf-7f3f-b46e-518eecb9affa\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"For some people, too much tightening can actually worsen an already overactive or tight pelvic floor.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"a41862a7-efdf-7f3f-b46e-518eecb9affa\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"If you can, see a pelvic floor physical therapist during pregnancy for an assessment, or follow a","n evidence-based program that teaches both engagement and relaxation.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"30c28461-607e-745c-b1bb-0ba6b3963b9c\"]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-7f21-8966-c7705eba6d2d\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Journaling captures what photos and videos cannot: your emotions, fears, excitement, questions, and the milestones that make this time yours.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Moments like the first time you feel your baby move can fade from memory, so writing them down helps preserve the experience.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"dce93289-fc2d-701c-9c11-0961fb3a114f\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Alongside journaling, start planning for postpartum now, not just for the baby, but for you.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Good preparation covers your recovery, sleep disruption, hormonal shifts, meals, practical help, and emotional support, not only baby supplies.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"4e76ff18-b457-7a52-8126-7f7a5118b61a\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The routine is simple: choose one manageable task each week.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"That might mean drafting a meal plan, talking through partner or family support, preparing comfortable postpartum clothing, or identifying a trusted person you can call on the hard days.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Week by week, these small steps build a safety net for the transition ahead.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This sentence summarizes the cumulative benefit of the weekly planning habit described in"," the source, helping learners see the long-term payoff without introducing new facts.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"outlineItemId\": \"01a0ece5-3ecd-73a4-9eaa-e32b3c1692d5\",\n      \"sentences\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Here is the full pattern: match your movement to your trimester, eat protein at every meal, and take your prenatal vitamin at night with food.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"fa06903c-8540-7e50-9188-568c594b21ce\", \"9e81e435-fab4-764f-83d3-5204b40898b5\", \"2b77cfe1-1bdd-7008-8cf4-8139f72a6b92\", \"43f06ae2-beb0-703b-89e0-7ce9ac8db8fd\", \"59033b68-f011-7e5d-8f35-aa1bc2fb5832\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Calm your mind with a clear information plan: know the red flags, bookmark trusted sources, and stop the late-night searching.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"cbc62292-71de-78eb-93e1-cf5532bf947d\", \"f245f1d0-3b10-75ee-8a6d-1e186f8b7b22\", \"b73821e8-2cc4-7e89-aed7-cdfc16f2ef61\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Prepare for birth by learning what labor actually involves and training your pelvic floor for both strength and relaxation.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"97f28d00-1622-7b1b-97c1-75effbb4a461\", \"6a171c18-28c8-7559-b82b-7a6ad772ad05\", \"30c28461-607e-745c-b1bb-0ba6b3963b9c\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"And look beyond birth by journaling your experience and tackling one postpartum planning task each week.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [\"b91f499f-4809-7274-9b35-db1432456f86\", \"1a5ed54b-8c0a-7bb8-89fe-ee8da33d8070\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You do not need to do all ten habits at once. Pick one to start this week, and let the rest follow.\",\n          \"sourceBlockIds\": [],\n          \"generatedAddition\": {\n            \"kind\": \"clarification\",\n            \"rationale\": \"This closing encouragement translates the ten-habit overview into a single low-pressure action step, which supports the lesson's promise of protecting sanity without adding new factual claims.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n","    }\n  ]\n}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":14011,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":63327,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0ece2-fd2f-7533-9408-bed00830d7cb"}}
